WEBVTT

00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:31.200
whether from an ethical perspective,

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:36.894
which is really crucial when it comes 
to stem cells, when it comes to AI,

00:19:36.894 --> 00:19:41.017
and when it comes to economy,
it provides a different framework.

00:19:41.017 --> 00:19:46.726
So, I think the importance of the language
comes not only because of its history,

00:19:46.726 --> 00:19:49.846
because of the number 
of speaking that language.

00:19:49.846 --> 00:19:52.336
I think it comes because of its roots

00:19:52.336 --> 00:19:55.880
of providing, if you would like, 
an alternative framework

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:59.060
from a set of values, 
from a set of cultures

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:02.210
that is truly addressing 
the future challenges